  "seoBody": "<h2 id=\"intro-message\">No first message</h2><ul><li>Check the number. UK mobiles start <code>07</code> or <code>+447</code>.</li><li>WhatsApp must be on that same number.</li><li>If they blocked unknown numbers, ask them to unblock our sender.</li><li>Still nothing? Remove the person and add them again.</li></ul><h2>Stopped halfway</h2><p>Answers so far are saved. Reply in the same WhatsApp chat and carry on.</p><h2 id=\"pdf-wrong\">The PDF looks wrong</h2><ul><li><strong>Missing question:</strong> did you add it after the Check started? Each Record keeps the Check it started with.</li><li><strong>Sideways photo:</strong> WhatsApp can lose the turn. Take the photo again, held upright.</li><li><strong>Missing answer:</strong> the question may have been skipped, or we could not read the reply. Look at the Record on the dashboard.</li></ul><h2>Error page with a code</h2><p>We are told at once. If it blocks you, email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a> with the code.</p><h2>Hit a limit</h2><p>Click the upgrade prompt on the dashboard. You pay the difference for the rest of the month.</p><h2 id=\"sign-in\">Cannot sign in</h2><ul><li>Sign-in links last 15 minutes. Ask for a new one.</li><li>Each link works once.</li><li>Asked for many links? Wait a few minutes.</li></ul><h2>Something else</h2><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a>. We reply within one business day.</p>",
